    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Sulfur Ignition</strong></i></u> is an irreverent racing game set in hell where players are condemned to compete at high speeds while battling each other, the game contains a good mix of high speed action, dark humor and lots of sarcasm!<br><br>Run around freely through hell, exploring 5 distinct areas which have their own theme and secrets, unlock new racing tracks, new cars and even some hidden challenges!<br><br>Win races to earn coins which you can use to upgrade your cars giving you access to more challenging tracks and also customize them to better fit your style.<br><br>Different tracks present different challenges and different cars have access to different items, making every race a unique challenge to beat!<br><br>Defeat every challenge and become the ultimate hell driver to get a chance to challenge the Lord of\u00a0 Darkness himself!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Sulfur Ignition</strong></i></u> is an irreverent racing game set in hell where players are condemned to compete at high speeds while battling each other, the game contains a good mix of high speed action, dark humor and lots of sarcasm!<br><br>Run around freely through hell, exploring 5 distinct areas which have their own theme and secrets, unlock new racing tracks, new cars and even some hidden challenges!<br><br>Win races to earn coins which you can use to upgrade your cars giving you access to more challenging tracks and also customize them to better fit your style.<br><br>Different tracks present different challenges and different cars have access to different items, making every race a unique challenge to beat!<br><br>Defeat every challenge and become the ultimate hell driver to get a chance to challenge the Lord of\u00a0 Darkness himself!</p>",
